  "notes": "Roche Bobois Arobase swivel armchair (AR01), design Antoine Fritsch & Vivien Durisotti. Sizes from Roche Bobois's technical sheet (technicals.roche-bobois.com/M142366512/TSv_AROBASE_2024(3).pdf, page 6): 89 wide, 86 deep, 71 high, seat height 40, seat depth 53. Not the 142 cm Arobase 1.5-seat sofa (AR02) nor its loose rectangular cushion (AR03). It turns on an upholstered swivel base that returns to its position by itself; in the app it stands as placed. model.glb is generated by `npx tsx tools/models/armchair-roche-bobois-arobase.ts` from its own geometry after the sheet's side, front and top drawings and Roche Bobois's photos: a plump round seat on an upholstered plinth set in under it, and a separate back, a thick oval pillow curved round the seat and leaning back, its foot behind the seat; the chrome plate in the middle of the back is shown as a plain bar. Roche Bobois makes it in all its coverings except rigid fabrics and velvets; the fabrics and leathers here are planning colours, not Roche Bobois's, and the velvets among them aren't offered for this chair. The seat is a surface, so cushions and throws can go on it."
